# Configuration file with credentials
config.txt

# Results files
*_Results_*.csv

# Archive previews and the manual review companion. Every -WhatIf run writes a
# preview and every run with a refused process writes a review list, both into
# the working directory, so without these the repository is dirty after a run.
# They carry tenant process names and ids; keep them out of version control.
Archive_Preview_*.csv
Archive_ManualReview_*.csv

# Delete plan ledgers. Written to the working directory by every Mode 5 run,
# including dry runs, so without this every run leaves the repository dirty.
# They can carry tenant process names and ids; keep them out of version control.
Delete_Plan_*.json
Delete_Plan_*.json.tmp

# PowerShell execution logs
*.log

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
~$*

# Windows thumbnail cache
Thumbs.db

# macOS metadata
.DS_Store

# Editor files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
